Move the single master onto the instances' Width coordinate.

The source has one master, at Width 5, while every instance sits at
the default Width 100. glyphsLib 6.14 writes a designspace whose Width
axis spans 5..5; fontmake finds no instance inside it and produces
nothing (the release was built with an older toolchain). With a single
master its coordinate is arbitrary, so the master's widthValue is set to 100.
The built font is pixel-identical to the release.

diff --git a/sources/NotoSansTifinagh.glyphs b/sources/NotoSansTifinagh.glyphs
index 254363a..a06eb81 100644
--- a/sources/NotoSansTifinagh.glyphs
+++ b/sources/NotoSansTifinagh.glyphs
@@ -850,7 +850,7 @@ verticalStems = (
 87,
 72
 );
-widthValue = 5;
+widthValue = 100;
 xHeight = 536;
 }
 );
